"5. Quiet names - name the one or two stocks that barely moved, with their percentages, so the reader knows what stayed stable. One sentence only." &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp;
"6. Data quality - state how many stocks returned valid data out of the total, and name any stock that was excluded." &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp;
