"Content rules: no financial advice, no predictions, no buy or sell recommendations. Do not speculate about news, events or causes. Use only the data below." &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp;
"Run summary for " &amp; runTimestamp &amp; ":" &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp; summaryFacts &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp; Environment.NewLine &amp;
